meta {
  name: Assistant
  seq: 23
}

docs {
  The signed-in member's personal assistant in this workspace. Each member
  gets exactly one, provisioned on first use — there is no assistant ID in
  any URL, and every route acts on the caller's own. All routes need the
  `assistant.use` permission (granted to members and up). A session, turn,
  memory or situation belonging to someone else's assistant answers `404`,
  not `403`.

  Chat is asynchronous: `Sessions - Send Message` returns `202` with a
  turn, and the reply streams over the private Reverb channel
  `workspaces.{workspaceId}.assistant-sessions.{sessionId}` (`turn.delta`,
  `turn.tool`, `turn.changed`). Poll `Turns - Get` if you aren't listening.
  Tools that need sign-off park the turn on `awaiting_approval` until
  `Turns - Decide` is called.

  Also here: personalization (`Styles`, `Memories`, `Tool Rules`), voice
  input (`Transcribe`), connected apps, situations raised by briefings,
  and the briefing, channel, inbox, meeting and trigger settings.

  Variables set as you go: `assistantSessionId`, `assistantTurnId`,
  `assistantMessageId`, `assistantToolCallId`, `assistantMemoryId`,
  `assistantStyleRevisionId`, `assistantSituationId`,
  `assistantSituationStepId`.
}
